  "about": {
    "title": "About Mipove",
    "ourStory": "Our Story",
    "story1": "Like all brilliant ideas, mipove was born in a moment, years ago, at a deserted cafe table, with coffee and papers spread out on the same table.",
    "story2": "The initial idea was simple, but important. We were creating products that would bring together all the craftsmen of Georgia in one space and allow the rest of the community to connect with them very quickly and securely. This idea has been around for a long time, abandoned, neglected. And after years of thought, hard work and determination, it blossomed, grew, refined and presented itself to you as mipove.com",
    "story3Strong": "Mipove changes that.",
    "story3": "Although the idea has been around for a long time, Mipovbe is taking its first steps in the online space and is ready to collaborate and develop with you.",
    "story4": "mipove is a vibrant community where you, the masters and the seekers of the masters, exist together in one space and mutually help each other, which was our original task and goal.",
